Preemptable kernel 
  everytime u do a syscall, your process is running, the kernel starts doing work for u, in ur process time.
  a lot of time kernel can't be preemptive.

  Linux kernel got this in Sept 2024, PREEMPT_RT, linux real time kernel.
  linux itself can preempt itself to let smth else run.


