SJF (Shortest job first).
  long process doesn't sabotage others.
  it checks the remaining processes time, and then picks the process with shortest time remaining.

  7 4 1 4
  0 2 4 5

  so first 0-7->p1, 8->p3, 9-11-> p2, 12-16-> p4

(priority queue we tend to talk about other things, like processes, not really scheduling, this wouldnt be there)

